자 유형은 미분류입니다. 이 자료를 슈퍼팩 지출로 표기하지 마세요.","주지사 등록 후보 전체 명부는 미확보. 지출에서 식별된 후보만 포함합니다."],"national_file":"usa_election_finance/2026/national-203aa90e24e5de7a.json"}},"categories":["super_pac","hybrid_pac","single_candidate_ie","other_independent_spender","unclassified","state_independent_expenditure_committee","state_independent_spender_unclassified"],"governor_source_directory":{"schema":"usa_state_campaign_finance_sources_v1","verified_on":"2026-09-10","directory_url":"https://www.fec.gov/introduction-campaign-finance/how-to-research-public-records/combined-federalstate-disclosure-and-election-directory/","note_ko":"공식 문서로 제공 방식을 확인한 출처 목록. API의 존재는 주지사 후보·지지/반대·정정·위원회 유형 매핑의 완성을 의미하지 않는다. 계정 없이 조회 가능한 자료에는 신고자 계정을 만들지 않는다.","states":{"MA":{"agency":"Massachusetts OCPF","access":"public_json_api","url":"https://api.ocpf.us/developers","api_base":"https://api.ocpf.us","authentication":"none_required_per_official_docs","independent_expenditure_mapping":"not_implemented","independent_expenditure_endpoint":"https://api.ocpf.us/miscreports/iepacs/reports/{year}","api_documentation":"https://api.ocpf.us/swagger/index.html","last_probe":{"date":"2026-09-10","result":"IEPAC_summary_available_report_rows_HTTP_500","status":"not_connected"}},"WA":{"agency":"Washington PDC","access":"soda_odata_api","url":"https://www.pdc.wa.gov/faq/do-you-have-data-api-programmers","catalog_url":"https://www.pdc.wa.gov/political-disclosure-reporting-data/open-data","authentication":"public_read_no_key_verified","independent_expenditure_mapping":"implemented_C6_governor_allocations_partial","dataset_id":"67cp-h962","api_endpoint":"https://data.wa.gov/resource/67cp-h962.json","metadata_url":"https://data.wa.gov/api/views/67cp-h962.json","limitations_ko":"C6.3의 주지사 배분액만. Electioneering Communications와 C4 제외. 슈퍼팩 분류·경선 단계 미확보."},"CA":{"agency":"California Secretary of State","access":"daily_bulk_zip_tsv","url":"https://www.sos.ca.gov/campaign-lobbying/helpful-resources/raw-data-campaign-finance-and-